{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord\/id"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/id"},"metadata":{"title":"id","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"EventRecord.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/EventRecord.swift#L23"},"externalID":"s:6Events11EventRecordV2id20FoundationEssentials4UUIDVvp","modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4UUIDV"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The record’s identifier: a random (version 4) UUID drawn when the record is made. A tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"draws it when its worker accepts the tracked event, before the record is enriched, stored"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered; a store keeps it with the record, so a redelivered record has the identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it had when first delivered."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4UUIDV","text":"UUID"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It identifies the record, not a person: it is drawn for this record alone, never derived"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the device, the user, the session or another record, and two records never share one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A collector that receives a record twice, as a redelivered record can be, keeps one copy by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord/id":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The record’s identifier: a random (version 4) UUID drawn when the record is made. A tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"draws it when its worker accepts the tracked event, before the record is enriched, stored"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered; a store keeps it with the record, so a redelivered record has the identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it had when first delivered."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"id","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4UUIDV"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord\/id","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/id","role":"symbol"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events":{"title":"Events","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The types every other module shares: the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the values its properties can hold, and the record a tracker makes of each event."}],"url":"\/documentation\/events"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EventRecord","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracked event: the